272:Answers one clip's spoken words with their times on the timeline, ready for `ripple_delete_ranges`. The Assistant uses it to [cut a false start](/cleanup/false-starts/). No menu item shows these words clip by clip. The nearest view is the [Transcript tab](/captions/transcript-tab/), which [`get_timeline_transcript`](#get_timeline_transcript) mirrors. It edits nothing, makes no undo step and never uploads anything.
